通配规则语义：单条样本命中 2 条规则 [("alarm","alarms"), ("archive","archive")]
payload = {"collected_ts_ns":"1790179908835360600", ... "device_ts_ns":"1700000000123456789", ...}
collected_ts_ns is_string=true / device_ts_ns is_string=true

闸门关闭：[拒绝签名] code=3000 AuthError；attach -> is_err=true, batch.auth.is_none=true
闸门开启（对照）：verify_batch -> ok
broker 不可达(127.0.0.1:1) -> code=6000 NetworkError（未 panic）
